    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "An Australian police officer named Jade Henderson has done something amazing recently. She "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "broke the world record",
            "ref": "v-break-record"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for the most pull-ups in one hour—she did 733! The old record was 725 pull-ups."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "To reach her goal, Jade did more than 12 pull-ups every minute for a full hour. “It was hard,” she said, “but I wanted to test my mind and body.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "At first, she wanted to try the 24-hour pull-up record. But she hurt her "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bicep",
            "zh": "二头肌"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " during training. She had to rest for six weeks. Later, she chose the one-hour challenge to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "avoid",
            "ref": "v-avoid"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " more injuries."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Jade did not have a big number in mind at first. She just wanted to beat the old record. Her hard work "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "paid off"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and she was very happy with the result. “I gave it all I had,” she said. “At that moment, I could not have done better.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Jade hopes her record will "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "inspire",
            "ref": "v-inspire"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " others. She said everyone should choose a goal and work hard every day. She added, “Believe you can, and you are already "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "halfway there",
            "zh": "成功了一半"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ".”"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
